OL,3,GNEWSAMum died day after hospital
OL,4,Adischarge, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum died from pneumonia less than 24
OL,7,Fhours after being discharged from
OL,8,Fhospital, an inquest has found.
OL,10,FMental health care assistant Tanya
OL,11,FMcCartney, 25, died at her Chesterfield
OL,12,Fhome in Derbyshire on 19 May 2023,
OL,13,Fafter being sent home from Chesterfield
OL,14,FRoyal Hospital with a course of
OL,15,Fantibiotics.
OL,17,FReturning a narrative conclusion at her
OL,18,Finquest, assistant coroner Anita Davis
OL,19,Fsaid that the hospital's decision to
OL,20,Fallow her to return home "contributed
OL,21,Fto the death".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
